            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "2. **Reaction with water**: They react with water to form alkaline solutions (hence the name!) and release hydrogen gas.",
            "start": 1303,
            "end": 1423
          },
          {
            "id": "p21",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "explanation"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "3. **Reaction with acids**: Alkaline earth metals react with acids to form salts and release hydrogen gas.",
            "start": 1424,
            "end": 1530
          },
